OL,3,GNEWSACarFest returning to Silverstone
OL,4,Afor second year
OL,5,
OL,6,FMusic and motoring festival CarFest
OL,7,Fwill return to Silverstone next summer
OL,8,Fafter a successful first year at the
OL,9,Fracing circuit.
OL,11,FMore than 30,000 people flocked to the
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire venue each day during
OL,13,Fthe August bank holiday weekend, to
OL,14,Fattend the festival which was founded
OL,15,Fby Chris Evans.
OL,17,F"Being at Silverstone gave us the
OL,18,Fchance to do everything we love about
OL,19,FCarFest on a whole new scale," said
OL,20,Fradio broadcaster Evans.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
